      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "bɛliyalew",
      "rationale": "בליעל kɔrɔ ye 'fɛn min bɛ nafa si tɛ, laseli' ye; n'an b'a sɛbɛn tɔgɔ cogo la, kɔrɔbɔyɔrɔ bɛnnen don 'mɔgɔ laseliw'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "בני בליעל",
      "rationale": "Bayɛlɛmabagaw bɛ fɛn fila in kɔrɔfɔ cogo kelen na: 'Belial denw' (tɔgɔ ye) walima 'laseli denw' (daɲɛ ye); Bamanankan na, an y'a kɛ daɲɛ ye dɔrɔn."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "tun",
      "rationale": "Bamanankan ka tɛmɛsira-taamasiyɛn farala a kan walasa היה ka tiɲɛ don; Heburukan bɛ a la ni waywayidaɲɛ ye."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Mɔgɔ kɔngow, bɛliyalew (Belial denw), ye u fara ɲɔgɔn kan a bolo, ka u bɛɛ kɔnɛya Rɛxoboam (Roboamu), Selomo denkɛ la; a tun ye denba ye, dusukunfiɲɛ ye, wa a ma se ka jɔ u ɲɛ.",
